## Development Workflow

### Quick Start
```bash
# 1. Setup environment
./src/scripts/setup.sh dev

# 2. Edit environment file
nano .env.development

# 3. Run migrations
./src/scripts/migrate.sh up dev

# 4. Deploy to development
./src/scripts/deploy.sh dev create
```

### Daily Development
```bash
# Check migration status
./src/scripts/migrate.sh status dev

# Apply new migrations
./src/scripts/migrate.sh up dev

# Deploy changes
./src/scripts/deploy.sh dev deploy

# Check deployment status
./src/scripts/deploy.sh dev status
```

### Testing Changes
```bash
# Validate migrations before committing
./src/scripts/migrate.sh validate

# Test specific migration
./src/scripts/migrate.sh test migration_name dev

# Generate app spec to test config
./src/scripts/deploy.sh dev generate
```

